{"1880490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meet me at NooN", "steam_appid": 1880490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/682d9f544b534a5b0e390d12c0c6b10d.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=420 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/682d9f544b534a5b0e390d12c0c6b10d.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/682d9f544b534a5b0e390d12c0c6b10d.mp4?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>The Grand Hourglass is broken and split into two spirits. Control the two spirits that create time loops each day.</i><br><br><i>Will you be able to figure out the new rules of the continuum ?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn &amp; Grid based platformer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/b8d1aad530294849a232a2bfc6f5deee.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/b8d1aad530294849a232a2bfc6f5deee.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>A timeline is showing how much turns you have to solve a level.<br>You can do one action by turn.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night, the twins spirits</strong> </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/a430b1b6375d5252d11e72cb7bd82d2a.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/a430b1b6375d5252d11e72cb7bd82d2a.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>You control two characters: one during the day, one during the night. They sure look like twins but they have unique behaviors. It's up to you to discover how to use their distinctiveness at your advantage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time loop and playback </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/acb0a9914ad6404b73177fcff3b58a58.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/acb0a9914ad6404b73177fcff3b58a58.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Each move you do with a character are recorded and will be played back while you're controlling the other character. It's like creating small time loops for each character.<br>Beware, the playback is not the same for our two spirits: The day-one will rewind its actions and the night-one will replay its own actions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Objective</strong> </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/89919a910144a345e86e787032c8b125.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/89919a910144a345e86e787032c8b125.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>There are two symbols disposed in the level: a sun and a moon.<br>To solve the levels you simply need to have the two characters on their corresponding symbol at the same time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complex interactions</strong> </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/2181d963658d3a9314b8734edd1af64e.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/2181d963658d3a9314b8734edd1af64e.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>The characters can interact with each other and these interactions will be recorded too creating complex playback pattern.<br>Intertwine their timelines to solve brain-melting puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No pressure</strong> </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/7a4f80299eb7cc7db0f86aecc0638e52.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=455 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/7a4f80299eb7cc7db0f86aecc0638e52.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>You can't lose and there is no time constraint in the game. If you make a mistake, navigate the timeline and go back in time !", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/682d9f544b534a5b0e390d12c0c6b10d.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" width=420 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/682d9f544b534a5b0e390d12c0c6b10d.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/ext